    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8356</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4401</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、お祖母さんの
ピーチパイ美味しかったわねぇ∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, Helio's peach pie was
absolutely scrumptious! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8812</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4402</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>警告。
&lt;Ines&gt;もリチア様も
あきらかに食べすぎだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Warning:
You and Master Lithia both
consumed an unadvised quantity.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9240</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4403</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だが、パイの美味しさは同意だ。
自分の調理ライブラリに
加えるに値する完成度だった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, I concur that the pie
was delicious. Truly a recipe
worthy of saving to my database.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4404</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あら、&lt;Kunzite&gt;。
あなた料理ができるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you can cook, &lt;Kunzite&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4405</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。料理は自分の得意分野だ。
結晶界でのリチア様の食膳は
自分が調理していた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. Culinary arts are my
area of expertise. I was responsible for
preparing Master Lithia's meals on Quartzia.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4406</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あら、だったら、いつか
街で一緒にお店を出さない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, then why don't we open up
a shop together in the city someday?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4407</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あなたなら、ひとりで
倍のパイが焼けるから
人件費が二分の一だし∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Knowing you, you could bake
twice as many pies as the average
baker, halving the cost of labor! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10652</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C4408</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……やめとけ、&lt;Kunzite&gt;。
パイは甘くても&lt;Ines&gt;の
人使いは甘くねぇぞ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Don't do it, &lt;Kunzite&gt;.
The pie may be sweet, but bein'
&lt;Ines&gt;'s slave sure as hell ain't.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
